{"ref":"BDB Aramaic, תַּמָּה","hw":"תַּמָּה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">תַּמָּה</span></big>  <strong>adv. there (</strong>so Egyptian Aramaic (RÉS <sup>361 B 5</sup> [also <span dir=\"rtl\">תנה</span><sup>A 4</sup>, so Cilic., Cooke <sup>68. 5</sup>, cf. Palm. <span dir=\"rtl\">תנן</span> ib. <sup>121. 3</sup>, Syriac <span dir=\"rtl\">ܬܢܳܢ</span>] S-C<sup>A 4, J 6</sup>); 𝔗 <span dir=\"rtl\">תַּמָּן</span>, Syriac <span dir=\"rtl\">ܬܰܡܳܢ</span>, v. BH <span dir=\"rtl\">שָׁם</span><strong>)</strong>;—<a data-ref=\"Ezra 5:17\" href=\"/Ezra.5.17\">Ezr 5:17</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezra 6:1\" href=\"/Ezra.6.1\">6:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezra 6:12\" href=\"/Ezra.6.12\">12</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מִן־ת׳</span> <em>thence</em> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 6:6\" href=\"/Ezra.6.6\">6:6</a>.","next":"BDB Aramaic, תְּמַהּ","prev":"BDB Aramaic, תְּלָתִין"}